---
/* Answer the booking questions before the final WhatsApp invitation. */
---

<section class="faq" aria-labelledby="faqTitle">
  <div class="shell">
    <h2 id="faqTitle">Before you book</h2>
    <details>
      <summary>Is the price per person or per car?</summary>
      <p>
        The listed trip prices are for the car, for your group. Homestays are extra, priced per
        person with breakfast and dinner.
      </p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Will we follow the route shown?</summary>
      <p>
        It’s a sample circuit with Gue included on day 3. Kunzum, Chandratal and the Manali crossing
        are seasonal. We’ll confirm your route on WhatsApp.
      </p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>What happens after I message?</summary>
      <p>
        Share your dates, group size and pickup city. We’ll send your trip plan and quote, then
        confirm the details with you before booking.
      </p>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>
